0017 fine-wall-noflux (Role 3 -> Role 1). Built against the COMMITTED Source/driver/TimeLoop.cpp of HEAD 1929665620 WITH patch 0015 applied (0015 adds BcStep::vel_bc wiring).
Needs commit 85cc2d7291 (GhostExchange BcStep::zero_wall_flux). Apply from the repo root after 0013/0014/0015: git apply 0017-fine-wall-noflux.patch
pressure_scheme_composite: after NO_FLUX of every level, a fine level zeroes FVX/FVY/FVZ on its INERT/MIRROR domain wall faces (FDS FVZ(K=0), FVZ(KBAR)), before
composite_average_down_flux and the PRHS. Fine boxes have no wall cells, so NO_FLUX left the VELOCITY_FLUX value there; it entered the fine RHS row k=0
((FVZ(K-1)-FVZ(K))/dz), the averaged-down coarse BZS, and the predictor/corrector W(K=0) = W - dt*(FVZ(0)+dH/dz); mirror_domain_edges then reset W(K=0)=0,
leaving max|div u - D| ~ dt*FVZ/dz in the k=0 row.

